    oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym "Medial dorsal cutaneous nerve" .

ILX:0797483 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Dorsal digital nerve of foot" ;
    definition: "A digital sensory nerve supplying the dorsal surface of one or more toes. These nerves arise primarily from the superficial fibular, deep fibular, or sural nerves." ;
